<title>CANADA: Vancouver Airport shows strong Sept cargo growth.</title>
<headline>Vancouver Airport shows strong Sept cargo growth.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargo traffic continued to boom in September at Vancouver International Airport (YVR), with ovedrall freight traffic rising 20.7 percent to 17,511 tonnes.</p>
<p>Import freight rose 26.8 percent to 8,184 tonnes, up from 6,456 tonnes in September 1995. Exports rose 15.8 percent to 9,327 tonnes.</p>
<p>The increases reflect a rise in international and U.S. flights at Vancouver, and a strengthening of the transpacific air freight market. -Air Cargo Newsroom Tel +44 171 542 7706 Fax +44 171 542 5017</p>
</text>
